# xterm-256color capabilities for the embedded SwiftTerm view.
#
# tmux uses smcup/rmcup to switch its *client* into an alternate screen.  That
# screen deliberately has no scrollback, so a native trackpad gesture can only
# become tmux copy-mode.  The embedded view owns its scrollback instead, so the
# client terminal intentionally omits those two capabilities.
infinite-scroll|Infinite Scroll embedded terminal,
	use=xterm-256color,
	smcup@,
	rmcup@,
